      "gridPos": {"h": 4, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0},
      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**MySQL (RDS) health.** Sourced from AWS RDS via Grafana Cloud's hosted CloudWatch integration. Polled every 60s.\n\nFiltered by the `$dbinstance` template variable (default `ams-prod-mysql`; change at the top of the dashboard to point at a different RDS instance).\n\n**Local dev:** the docker-compose MySQL has no equivalent exporter (mysqld-exporter was removed alongside the rest of the local observability stack). When `$environment=local`, panels show No data and operators fall back to `docker compose exec mysql mysql -e 'SHOW STATUS'` for ad-hoc checks. RDS Enhanced Monitoring is the production replacement."
      },
      "title": "MySQL Server Health",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {"type": "cloudwatch", "uid": "cloudwatch"},
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "short"}, "overrides": []},
      "gridPos": {"h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 0, "y": 4},
      "id": 2,
      "options": {"colorMode": "value", "graphMode": "area", "justifyMode": "auto", "orientation": "auto", "reduceOptions": {"calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false}, "textMode": "auto"},
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {"type": "cloudwatch", "uid": "cloudwatch"},
          "namespace": "AWS/RDS",
          "metricName": "DatabaseConnections",
          "statistic": "Average",
          "dimensions": {"DBInstanceIdentifier": "$dbinstance"},
          "region": "default",
          "period": "60",
          "legendFormat": "connections",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Connections (Current)",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {"type": "cloudwatch", "uid": "cloudwatch"},
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "percent", "thresholds": {"mode": "absolute", "steps": [{"color": "green", "value": null}, {"color": "yellow", "value": 70}, {"color": "red", "value": 90}]}}, "overrides": []},
      "gridPos": {"h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 6, "y": 4},
      "id": 3,
      "options": {"colorMode": "value", "graphMode": "area", "justifyMode": "auto", "orientation": "auto", "reduceOptions": {"calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false}, "textMode": "auto"},
      "targets": [
        {
